    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Dominay a competitive game in a fantasy world where you will become a great master of powerful weapons and spells. If you are a player who likes a PvP you can score for your team by fighting enemy players, but if you prefer a PvE you can score for your team by fulfilling challenges scattered in the forest, you decide.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADVANTAGE</h2>In each game you can choose your advantage. Each has a unique power that determines what type of player you will be.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/d9d9435432d6fa35ab9075c51884e2a9.poster.avif?t=1672264808\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/d9d9435432d6fa35ab9075c51884e2a9.webm?t=1672264808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/d9d9435432d6fa35ab9075c51884e2a9.mp4?t=1672264808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEAPONS</h2>Weapons are your most important skills, you can find them in chests. Each weapon has a different style for you.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/a70eb0c2ba7667de6215b850dabc5669.poster.avif?t=1672264808\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/a70eb0c2ba7667de6215b850dabc5669.webm?t=1672264808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/a70eb0c2ba7667de6215b850dabc5669.mp4?t=1672264808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ITEMS</h2>It's important that you know the forest well, because the more you explore the map, the more items you'll find that will help you in the battles that await you in the forest.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/0bc4424fef0682b7eb1f45df094b1e39.poster.avif?t=1672264808\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/0bc4424fef0682b7eb1f45df094b1e39.webm?t=1672264808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/0bc4424fef0682b7eb1f45df094b1e39.mp4?t=1672264808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHALLENGES</h2>To win the game in Dominay, you'll be able to complete challenges against the opposing team around the map. For each of these tasks, your team will receive a score. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/b8992c807e9f04923edf200394678ee7.poster.avif?t=1672264808\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/b8992c807e9f04923edf200394678ee7.webm?t=1672264808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1884950/extras/b8992c807e9f04923edf200394678ee7.mp4?t=1672264808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
